  "title": "Job retries in the orders worker",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narrative",
      "id": "intro",
      "markdown": "A worker leases a job for a visibility timeout of 5 minutes. An attempt is one run of the job. After a third failed attempt the job moves to the dead-letter queue, and an operator can requeue it."
